@page "/stream"
@attribute [StreamRendering(true)]
@inject StreamService Stream
@* Part15 - [StreamRendering] + IAsyncEnumerable：占位先渲染，数据流式补齐 *@

<PageTitle>Part15 · Stream Rendering</PageTitle>
<h1>Stream Rendering</h1>

<p><code>[StreamRendering(true)]</code> 让组件先渲染占位，<code>IAsyncEnumerable</code> 的数据逐项流式补到 DOM，不必等全部就绪。</p>

<p>当前已渲染：@_rendered.Count 项</p>
<ul>
    @foreach (var item in _rendered)
    {
        <li>@item</li>
    }
</ul>

@code {
    private readonly List<string> _rendered = new();

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        await foreach (var item in Stream.GetItemsAsync(10))
        {
            _rendered.Add(item);
            StateHasChanged();
        }
    }
}